abstract: >-
  Local, memoryful, generative primitive designed for integration into larger
  cognitive architectures. Hardware-bound actuator of a tripartite AI system
  (AI-1, AI-2, AI-3) providing ultra-low-latency, ultra-low-power reactive control.
